            "review_title": "Review at Binh An Village Saigon",
            "review_text": "Sher H\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nRomantic and memorable Christmas night!\nDec 2014 • Couples\nBinh An exceeded all my expectations and it was mainly due to the effort from Suong (who i presume manages the place)! I had requested for a little surprise for my gf, with scattered roses and a romantic candlelight dinner, but Suong did way more than I requested! She had multi-colored roses scattered along the pathway which led up to our very own private hut, and more in shape of hearts leading up to the deck.. where she drew and designed what I had requested perfectly! It was such a memorable and romantic night, with cool breeze as we watched the sunset and enjoyed the amazing food.. service was attentive and I am so grateful for this wonderful night! I'll definitely recommend Binh An for larger events, weddings, anniversaries, or simply romantic dinners as you will feel so peaceful away from the city hustle! Thank you once again to Suong for all the effort, I deeply appreciate it and will be back soon!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 25, 2014",
